    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000314",
    "title": "The Double Search: Studies in Atonement and Prayer",
    "description": "The public-domain text of The Double Search: Studies in Atonement and Prayer by Rufus M. Jones, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 15,
    "tags": [
