    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000333",
    "title": "The Sin and Danger of Self-Love",
    "description": "The public-domain text of The Sin and Danger of Self-Love by Robert Cushman, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 13,
