    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000343",
    "title": "David: Five Sermons",
    "description": "The public-domain text of David: Five Sermons by Charles Kingsley, preserved across 5 original sections with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 15,
    "tags": [
